tract and the state:\n  DECODE_LADDER.md          the ordered work list, the stop condition, and the hard invariants\n  DECODE_ZENITH_FINDINGS.md the measured cost model and the plan it came from","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
